n\n**未知/未确认部分**：\n- 缺乏应用层具体的内存分配堆栈及溢出细节，仅能确认是资源上限导致的强制终止，无法定位代码中具体的内存泄漏或分配位置。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 23.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 48.0s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v17/workload: 48.0s (Evidence 40.1s, RCA 7.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 13.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v17/workload**: pod-oomkilled\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 84.518, "metrics": {"run_id": "3139585cda3b42cc", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 84.52390241622925, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "50%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-oomkilled"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.9, "weighted_score": 0.18, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 90%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 84523.90241622925, "llm_calls": 11, "llm_duration_ms": 80591.19772911072, "tool_calls": 10, "executed_tool_call